        "text": "Ask for sample payslips, contribution remittance receipts, and the withholding tax record. Check that the names on the payroll match the people doing the work. Look for late or partial remittances, because those gaps can become the principal's liability. Keep the evidence in the vendor file and refresh it at least annually, with a note on any item that could not be verified."
