        "text": "The contractor should hold employment contracts, job descriptions, attendance records, training logs, and personnel files. These records show that the contractor manages the employment relationship. A buyer does not need to read every file, but it should confirm that the records exist and are current. Ask how the contractor protects the personal data in those files, including who can open them and when they are deleted."
